# Template Profile

This project was generated with the `{{.Profile}}` goboot profile.

Profiles select visible lint, test, and documentation defaults. They do not
silently enable or disable generator services, and explicit values in service
configuration remain authoritative.

{{ if eq .Profile "minimal" }}

## Minimal baseline

- Standard-library Go tests by default
- Fast `go test ./...` command
- Small correctness and security-focused Go linter set
{{ else if eq .Profile "enterprise" }}

## Enterprise baseline

- Ginkgo/Gomega scaffolding by default
- Race detection, randomized test order, coverage, and extended timeout
- Strict cyclomatic-complexity threshold
{{ else if eq .Profile "oss" }}

## OSS baseline

- Ginkgo/Gomega scaffolding by default
- Race detection and atomic coverage mode
- Public-project lint and documentation baseline
{{ else }}

## Standard baseline

- Ginkgo/Gomega scaffolding by default
- Race detection and coverage
- Balanced lint complexity threshold
{{ end }}

Change the root `profile` value and regenerate to select another baseline.
